de Aqua Optima filtra eficientemente el agua para reducir las impurezas, incluido el cloro, la cal, los herbicidas, los pesticidas, el plomo, los metales pesados &#8203;&#8203;y los micropl\u00e1sticos.<\/p><p><b>Filtros r\u00e1pidos<\/b><\/p><p>Los filtros Evolve+ est\u00e1n dise\u00f1ados para eliminar las impurezas del agua de forma eficaz y r\u00e1pida. Cada filtro tiene una vida \u00fatil recomendada de 30 d\u00edas y un m\u00e1ximo de 100 litros de agua.<\/p><br><\/div><div><h2>Especificaci\u00f3n<\/h2><p><ul><li><b>Modelo <\/b>AUR001<\/li><li><b>Dimensiones del producto<\/b> 40,4 x 22,1 x 33,6 cent\u00edmetros<\/li><li><b>Capacidad<\/b> 3,8 litros<\/li><li><b>Potencia<\/b> \/ Vatios 2100 vatios<\/li><li><b>Voltaje <\/b>240<\/li><li><b>Nivel de ruido<\/b> 70 dB<\/li><li><b>Peso del producto<\/b> 5,14 kg<\/li><\/ul><div><p><b>*Incluye 1 filtro Evolve + que reduce los micropl\u00e1sticos, y&nbsp;<span style='background-color: initial;'>filtra el cloro, la cal, los herbicidas, pesticidas, plomo y&nbsp;<\/span><span style='background-color: initial;'>metales pesados del agua del grifo<\/span><\/b><\/p><\/div><\/p><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"AQUA OPTIMA","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":6.6,"unit_price":132,"unit_price_tax":132,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cocina","sub_category":"Jarras de Agua - Hervidores","quantity":2,"brand":"AQUA OPTIMA","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_aqo-pae-disp%20aurora%20staur001_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":125}}},"5601082058658":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["5601082058658",false],"wholesale_price":[13.5,false],"price":[20.5,false],"id_tax_rule